OL,3,GNEWSACovid inquiry urges UK`Ireland    
OL,4,Apandemic co-ordination in future       
OL,6,FThe UK should coordinate its response  
OL,7,Fto any future pandemic with the        
OL,8,FRepublic of Ireland because of the     
OL,9,Fadded complexity of disease control    
OL,10,Facross the Irish border, the Covid-19  
OL,11,Finquiry has said.                      
OL,13,FIn its latest 'Test, trace and isolate'
OL,14,Freport into the programme of test and  
OL,15,Ftrace, it said cooperation was needed  
OL,16,F"to ensure that border control measures
OL,17,Fare effective and operable in          
OL,18,Fpractice".                             
